<item><title>Equatorial Guinea orders design talks for five proposed cultural sites</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gq/equatorial-guinea-orders-design-talks-for-five-proposed-0930c4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gq/equatorial-guinea-orders-design-talks-for-five-proposed-0930c4/</guid><category>Equatorial Guinea</category><description>South Korea&apos;s TAEIN Development, an architectural firm, presented plans for museums in three cities and cultural centres in Annobón and Ciudad de La Paz.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:35:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gq.jpg" length="36574" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gq.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Equatorial Guinea sets six-day schedule for free hospital-ship care</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gq/equatorial-guinea-sets-six-day-schedule-for-free-hospital-905e40/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gq/equatorial-guinea-sets-six-day-schedule-for-free-hospital-905e40/</guid><category>Equatorial Guinea</category><description>The health ministry assigns provinces to treatment days in Bata, with consultations, procedures and several medical specialties available at no charge.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:28:32 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gq.jpg" length="36574" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gq.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
